<title>USA: Cali buys One Bridge Plaza in Fort Lee, NJ.</title>
<headline>Cali buys One Bridge Plaza in Fort Lee, NJ.</headline>
<dateline>CRANFORD, N.J. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cali Realty Corp said on Tuesday that it has acquired One Bridge Plaza located in Fort Lee, N.J., for $26.8 million in cash.</p>
<p>Cali said that the 200,000 square-foot building is 92 percent leased to over 30 tenants.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was not immediately available to say from whom Cali bought the property.</p>
